## Eagle

One team member is a true believer in the machine before the first experiment has even been run — fully convinced the machine will work and deeply invested in the outcome. The other three team members are mostly just humoring them; their eyes and thoughts are really on other jobs and research they are planning to move on to. (human)

IDEA: Should one of the characters be autistic or OCD-coded? Before an experiment, as a means to try and sync his mind across universes, he listens to the same song — a trick he has been doing his whole life already to calm himself during a freakout episode. The OCD character would ultimately be less prone to divergence than the other characters, and is more diligent and fearful of preventing divergence than the others. (human)

